    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA FitzGerald Chambers are delighted to offer No 4A Aughrim Villas, Stoneybatter to the market. The property qualifies for the Vacant Homes Grants, it has been vacant for 15 years. The family fitted grids to the windows and door to protect the integrity of the building. Located on a lovely elevated terrace of two-storey red brick period houses, built c.1890. The boasts a lovely entrance with a small garden to front. \r\n\r\nThis period property (Circa 98m2) offers spacious accommodation with many original features. The accommodation consists of large entrance hall, two large reception rooms and a kitchen and a downstairs bathroom. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and a bathroom.  The property also boasts a garage with vehicular access to the rear lane. It also comes with  a separate pedestrian access to a west facing patio garden. \r\n\r\nThis property is superbly located just off the NCR in the ever-popular Stoneybatter. The location could not be better being adjacent to Stoneybatter village, which has fast become a mecca for fashionable shops, cafes, restaurants and gastro bars. The Luas, Heuston station, Phoenix Park, Mater Hospital, Grangegorman DIT, The Four Courts and Kings Inn are only a short walk away, and Dublin city centre is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThis property has many of its original features. It will benefit from modernisation and redecorating. \r\n\r\nViewing recommended for purchasers looking for lovely period home with huge potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall   \tOriginal plaster coving, tiled floor, Understair Storage\r\n\r\nReception 1       \tFeature cast iron fireplace with slate surround, open fire,  tiled floor, fitted units\r\n\t        \r\nReception 2       \tFeature cast iron fireplace, open fire, \r\n  \t\t\t\t\t                \r\nHall \t      \t\t\r\nKitchen\t\t\tFitted kitchen access to rear yard/garden\r\nDownstairs Bathroom\tShower unit, W.c. Whb\r\nUpstairs Hall \t\r\nBed 1\t\t\tCast iron feature fireplace\r\n\r\nBed 2\t\t\tCast iron feature fireplace\r\n\r\nBed 3\t\t\tLaminated timber floor\r\n      \r\nBathroom\t         White suite, Shower unit\r\n\r\nGardens\t         Rear west facing garden with garage with vehicular access to rear via shared laneway  \r\n         \r\nGarage \t\tAccess to rear lane through garage door & pedestrian entrance\r\n\r\nHeating \t\tGas fired central heating, Double glazed windows"
